 "_sDescription": "Add Tricky from the Madness Combat series to FNF!",
 "_bGenerateTableOfContents": false,
 "_sText": "PC Requirements:<br><br>Any 2016+ Integrated/Dedicated GPU<br>Any recent cpu from the last 5 years.<br>12gb+ (this is a must need)<br>Recommended to play on an SSD (preferably a fast one)<br><br>We are happy to release the FULL Tricky Mod after a long time!<br><br>After months of harsh development, we're finally ready to release it!<br>Some sticks and stones may have been in our way for it to take this long, but better late than never.<br>Thank you for your patience!<br><br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL4pZAwHWpVFyG7coGhLKgR1ijGu7u1T1s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"SelectedElement\">Here's a link to the music</a><br><br>Thank you so much to the people that worked on this with me, it has been fun and it most definitely still will be fun until Version 2 comes out.<br><br>Rozebud<br>Kadedev<br>Cval<br>JADS<br>Mor\u00d8<br>YingYang<br><br>Special Thanks to Tom Fulp for lending us certain SFX that have been used for Tricky in Version 2<br><br>Also a BIG thanks to Krinkels for looking over the project here and there, being the guy who created Madness Combat and all!<br><br>I hope everyone has a good time playing and we'll enjoy seeing people doing exactly that!<br><br>btw, you may wanna take a look into freeplay AFTER BEATING THE ENTIRE CLOWN MODE ON HARD<br><br>[Alterations of this mod for your project or remixes are allowed aslong as we have been asked and credited]",
